<title>USA: United Technologies Chair Daniell retires.</title>
<headline>United Technologies Chair Daniell retires.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Technologies said on Monday that Robert Daniell will retire next April from his post as chairman of the board of directors.  </p>
<p>The company said Daniell planned to retire on April 29 and allow George David, the company's president and chief executive officer, to replace him.</p>
<p>United Technologies provides high-technology products and support systems to the aerospace, building systems and automotive industries.</p>
</text>
